{"key":"8a83a4bae5c34985","source_file":"Potts Pr - Py.json","source_id":42666,"source_url":"concordance-pulpit-ppl-pulpitum","term":"Pulpit","headwords":["Pulpit"],"latin":["Pulpitum"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Pulpit"],"latin":["Pulpitum"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AC","AR","CL","HH","SE","TCR"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"1764","subsection":null},"text":"Pulpits seen as representatives.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AC","section":"10833","subsection":null},"text":"(Pulpits used by preachers in the Sixth Earth.)","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"HH","section":"223","subsection":null},"text":"(In Heaven) the preacher stands in a pulpit on the east.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"HH","section":"223","subsection":null},"text":"No one is allowed to stand behind the pulpit. (Explained.)","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AR","section":"484","subsection":"7"},"text":"Behold a circus, and in the middle a pulpit...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"9","subsection":"2"},"text":"All had turned away from the pulpit...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"23","subsection":"2"},"text":"(Position of the pulpit in a temple in Heaven.)","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"24","subsection":null},"text":"The priest (then) ascended the pulpit, and preached...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"269","subsection":"4"},"text":"(The devil said), When I was upon the pulpit, I thought that I would speak rightly. Explained.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"363","subsection":"end"},"text":"When a priest is preaching from zeal, he... bangs the pulpit.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"381","subsection":"end"},"text":"(A kind of pulpit in a palace there.)","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"14","subsection":"3"},"text":"Thinks God is only a word sounded from the pulpits.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"55","subsection":"end"},"text":"Thus the adytum, altar, and pulpit, would stand without protection.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"146","subsection":"end"},"text":"When they ascend the pulpit... they are carried away by a zeal which with many is from infernal love.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"519","subsection":null},"text":"They are like the pulpits therein, where the Word is not...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"3396","subsection":null},"text":"Occurs. LJPost 292:end. LJPost 5M 14.","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"pulpit-8a83a4","url":"/meta/potts/pulpit-8a83a4/"}